    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Model the number or probability of recognized infraspecific varieties as a function of range size, occupancy and abundance across regional floras, controlling sampling and taxonomy. Positive associations for all three dominance measures support the claim.";
