    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.1.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Abundance is poorly estimated by opportunistic occurrences.", "Sampling effort inflates both range and recorded varieties.";
